silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_4_P_A_#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode4 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode4 is the set of vet records of type A observed for Mittens, concretely the baseline body-mass and ownership records at visit_0. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P(A)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
